    "https://www.cornerstone.edu/university-offices/career-services": {
      "title": "Career Services",
      "description": "Career Services | Cornerstone University About Us Athletics Alumni Wisdom Conversations Give 616.949.5300 Visit Campus Apply Cornerstone University Academics Admissions Online Student Life Tuition & Aid 616.949.5300 Search All Programs Associate Degrees Bachelor’s Degrees Master’s Degrees Doctoral Degree Online Degrees Certificates Minors Schools & Seminary First Year Online Graduate SOAR™ Mobile Transfer Dual Enrollment International Students Apply Net Price Calculator Military & Veteran Benefits Apply for Aid Scholarships & Grants Loans On-Campus Experience Online Experience Seminary Experience Career Services Student Services & Resources Online Admissions Online Degrees SOAR™ Mobile Degrees Online Experience Center for Academic Success Office of Career and Life Calling Career Services University Offices Students Employers Alumni Parents Please Select Students Employers Alumni Parents Welcome to Career and Life Calling’s Career Services! Here, students find support, direction, and confidence as they pursue God’s calling and prepare for meaningful careers. Guided by the Cornerstone Advantage™, we help students grow as morally grounded, career-ready leaders through personalized coaching, practical tools, and opportunities for real-world experience. Our Services Personalized career and calling coaching Major and career exploration resources Résumé, cover letter, interview prep and Internship search support Graduate school planning and application assistance Access to Handshake and career development tools Employer job and internship postings/campus recruitment Career Exploration Resume & Interviews Who’s Hiring On Campus Jobs & Internships Employers Handshake The Cornerstone Advantage™: Readying You for Life, Career & Influence Moral Goodness Academic Expertise Experiential Learning Leadership Learning Talent Acceleration This meeting gave me more confidence and a more open mind about my future career. —Colin H. It gave me clarity about how to approach the future and confidence that I’m heading the in the right direction. —Kyler N. I left the meeting feeling like I had a clearer direction and a plan for how to intentionally develop my skills moving forward. —Coby F. I left that conversation very encouraged and excited to see what the Lord has in store for me. —Carson K. Cornerstone University Contact P: 616.949.5300 E: info@cornerstone.edu Address 1001 East Beltline Ave NE Grand Rapids , MI 49525 Hours MON - FRI: 8 a.m. - 5 p.m. SAT & SUN: Closed Plan a Visit Apply Want To Learn More About CU? Request Info Apply Today Connect With CU Instagram Facebook YouTube LinkedIn Cornerstone University Get In Touch 1001 East Beltline Avenue NE Grand Rapids, MI 49525 616.949.5300 CONTACT US Helpful Links Accreditation Faculty Directory Maps & Directions Library Current Students Careers at CU Facility Virtual Tour University Offices Title IX Privacy Policy Campus Store 91.3 WCSG Academic Catalog Events Cornerstone University admits students of any race, color, national and ethnic origin to all the rights, privileges, programs, and activities generally accorded or made available to students at the school. We do not discriminate on the basis of race, color, national and ethnic origin in administration of its educational policies, admissions policies, scholarship and loan programs, and athletic and other school-administered programs. © 2026 Cornerstone University. All Rights Reserved. About Us Academic Programs All Programs Associate Degrees Bachelor’s Degrees Master’s Degrees Doctoral Degrees Online Degrees SOAR™ Mobile Degrees Certificates Minors Schools & Seminary Admissions View All Admissions First Year Online Graduate SOAR™ Mobile Transfer Dual Enrollment International Students Apply Student Experience Overview Campus Experience Online Experience Seminary Experience Career Services Resources Tuition + Financial Aid Overview Net Price Calculator Military & Veteran Benefits Apply For Aid Scholarships & Grants Loans Alumni Athletics Contact Us Events Apply Today Current Students Give to Cornerstone Submit Close Search Suggested Academics Admissions Tuition & Financial Aid Student Life Common About Cornerstone University Offices Faculty & Staff Directory Give to CU Recent News Cornerstone University Extends Tuition Freeze for Fall 2026–27, 2nd Consecutive Year New Wisdom & Influence Podcast Debut from Cornerstone University Cornerstone Enrollment Rises With Career-ready, Christian Worldview Focus"
